# AWS provider (hashicorp/aws) is NOT managed here. It is pinned per-module in
# each module's/root's versions.tf (>= 6.46.0, < 7.0.0), not via asdf.
# AWS roots/modules (modules/aws/**, envs/aws/**) auto-flow through
# validate-all / lint / test / docs / security because scripts/terraform-roots.sh
# discovers roots structurally and has no cloud filter.
# CI validates roots in a fixed number of shards (terraform-plan.yml), so the
# root count no longer approaches GitHub's 256-leg matrix cap. CI needs
# registry egress to download the hashicorp/aws provider.
#
# trivy replaces tfsec (EOL, folded into Trivy): keep it equal to the
# trivy-action `version:` in .github/workflows/reusable-security.yml.
